b) In case of the complete or partial expropriation of the land plot with houses, the land plot with the houses or supporting facilities, if the land plot area is smaller than the residential land recognition limit as stipulated in clause 5 Article 141 of the Land Law, compensation shall be made for the entire expropriated land area;

c) In case of the expropriation of land area used for non-agricultural production, business, commerce, or service purposes, compensation shall be made based on the actual expropriated land area. The type of land for compensation shall be the same as the land granted by the State with land levy payment and with a long-term stable land use term;

