2. Households or individuals that have been continuously using land with houses, land with houses and supporting facilities from December 18, 1980, to before October 15, 1993, without any land use right documents, if they are eligible for compensation stipulated in clause 1, Article 5 of this Decree, they shall be compensated for land as follows:

