2. [10] A persons whose application for residency is rejected by the foreign country and is also not regulated by any international agreement on repatriation shall be issued with a passport as follows:
a) A Vietnam representative office located overseas shall receive application from the competent authority of host country or application for a passport and 02 pictures from the person whose application for residency is rejected by the foreign country, completed application form using defined template and personal identification documents issued by the Vietnamese competent authority (if any);

