2. The training program for laws regarding rights to plant varieties includes Vietnamese laws; international treaties and cooperation agreements regarding plant variety protection in which Vietnam is a member;
professional skills in rights representation for plant varieties and DUS testing; professional skills in searching and using information regarding plant variety protection including:

a) Topic 1: Overview of the Plant Variety Protection System (introduction to the International Union for the Protection of New Varieties of Plants (UPOV) and the UPOV Convention, international agreements and treaties on plant variety protection to which Vietnam is a member, and other international cooperation activities on plant variety protection);
