d) Written description of the identity characters and photos of the person requested for transfer as provided for by international law and practice;

dd) Documents and materials certifying the duration for which the person requested for transfer has served his/her imprisonment sentences in the country requested for transfer and the remaining duration for which he/she shall serve his/her imprisonment sentences in the receiving country;
