Article 7. Jurisdiction of inspectors

1.[6] The inspector of the Ministry of National Defense, the Ministry of Public Security, State Bank of Vietnam;
the Government Inspectorate; the Provincial Inspectorate; the Cipher Inspector, Radiation and Nuclear Safety Inspector, Vietnam Maritime Inspector, Vietnam Inland Waterways Inspector, Vietnam Civil Aviation Inspector, State Securities Inspector has the jurisdiction to:

