2. The annulment or issuance of decisions specified in clause 1 of this Article shall only apply to the decisions on administrative penalties specified in Part two of the Law on handling of administrative violations.

The cancellation or replacement of measures to prevent and ensure the handling of administrative violations shall comply with the provisions set forth in Part four of the Law on handling of administrative violations.

